From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ran Wang <wangra@google.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 17:28:16 -0400
Subject: D3D11: Fix uniform and structured buffer partial update and zeroing

Prevent range-cache storages from becoming mLatestBufferStorage, route
partial copySubData on uniform buffers through staging, clamp
copyFromStorage ranges, and zero-fill uninitialized tail bytes in
dynamic uniform and structured buffers.

Test:
    angle_end2end_tests --gtest_filter="*CopySubDataPartialOverwritePreservesRemainingUniformData*:*UninitializedStructuredBufferRangeCacheAndUpdate*"
Bug: b/550626693
Change-Id: I6b5382f0788843faaa88e9046c66ea93d6552384
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/angle/angle/+/8480731
Commit-Queue: Ran Wang <wangra@google.com>
Reviewed-by: Shahbaz Youssefi <syoussefi@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Quyen Le <lehoangquyen@google.com>

